'>{}</span>", "ja492:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja492:19.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja492:19.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja492:19.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja492:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja492:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja492:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja492:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja492:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja492:21.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja492:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja492:0.2": "Pakiṇṇakanipāta ", "ja492:0.3": "Sālikedāravagga ", "ja492:0.4": "9. Tacchasūkarajātaka ", "ja492:1.1": "“Yadesamānā vicarimha, ", "ja492:1.2": "pabbatāni vanāni ca; ", "ja492:1.3": "Anvesaṁ vicariṁ ñātī, ", "ja492:1.4": "teme adhigatā mayā. ", "ja492:2.1": "Bahuñcidaṁ mūlaphalaṁ, ", "ja492:2.2": "bhakkho cāyaṁ anappako; ", "ja492:2.3": "Rammā cimā girīnajjo, ", "ja492:2.4": "phāsuvāso bhavissati. ", "ja492:3.1": "Idhevāhaṁ vasissāmi, ", "ja492:3.2": "saha sabbehi ñātibhi; ", "ja492:3.3": "Appossukko nirāsaṅkī, ", "ja492:3.4": "asoko akutobhayo”. ", "ja492:4.1": "“Aññampi leṇaṁ pariyesa, ", "ja492:4.2": "sattu no idha vijjati; ", "ja492:4.3": "So taccha sūkare hanti, ", "ja492:4.4": "idhāgantvā varaṁ varaṁ”. ", "ja492:5.1": "“Ko numhākaṁ idha sattu, ", "ja492:5.2": "ko ñātī susamāgate; ", "ja492:5.3": "Duppadhaṁse padhaṁseti, ", "ja492:5.4": "taṁ me akkhātha pucchitā”. ", "ja492:6.1": "“Uddhaggarājī migarājā, ", "ja492:6.2": "balī dāṭhāvudho migo; ", "ja492:6.3": "So taccha sūkare hanti, ", "ja492:6.4": "idhāgantvā varaṁ varaṁ”. ", "ja492:7.1": "“Na no dāṭhā na vijjanti, ", "ja492:7.2": "balaṁ kāye samohitaṁ; ", "ja492:7.3": "Sabbe samaggā hutvāna, ", "ja492:7.4": "vasaṁ kāhāma ekakaṁ”. ", "ja492:8.1": "“Hadayaṅgamaṁ kaṇṇasukhaṁ, ", "ja492:8.2": "Vācaṁ bhāsasi tacchaka; ", "ja492:8.3": "Yopi yuddhe palāyeyya, ", "ja492:8.4": "Tampi pacchā hanāmase”. ", "ja492:9.1": "“Pāṇātipātā virato nu ajja, ", "ja492:9.2": "Abhayaṁ nu te sabbabhūtesu dinnaṁ; ", "ja492:9.3": "Dāṭhā nu te migavadhāya na santi, ", "ja492:9.4": "Yo saṅghapatto kapaṇova jhāyasi”. ", "ja492:10.1": "“Na me dāṭhā na vijjanti, ", "ja492:10.2": "Balaṁ kāye samohitaṁ; ", "ja492:10.3": "Ñātī ca disvāna sāmaggī ekato, ", "ja492:10.4": "Tasmā ca jhāyāmi vanamhi ekako. ", "ja492:11.1": "Imassudaṁ yanti disodisaṁ pure, ", "ja492:11.2": "Bhayaṭṭitā leṇagavesino puthu; ", "ja492:11.3": "Te dāni saṅgamma vasanti ekato, ", "ja492:11.4": "Yatthaṭṭhitā duppasahajja te mayā. ", "ja492:12.1": "Pariṇāyakasampannā, ", "ja492:12.2": "sahitā ekavādino; ", "ja492:12.3": "Te maṁ samaggā hiṁseyyuṁ, ", "ja492:12.4": "tasmā nesaṁ na patthaye”. ", "ja492:13.1": "“Ekova indo asure jināti, ", "ja492:13.2": "Ekova seno hanti dije pasayha; ", "ja492:13.3": "Ekova byaggho migasaṅghapatto, ", "ja492:13.4": "Varaṁ varaṁ hanti balañhi tādisaṁ”. ", "ja492:14.1": "“Na heva indo na seno, ", "ja492:14.2": "napi byaggho migādhipo; ", "ja492:14.3": "Samagge sahite ñātī, ", "ja492:14.4": "na byagghe kurute vase”. ", "ja492:15.1": "“Kumbhīlakā sakuṇakā, ", "ja492:15.2": "saṅghino gaṇacārino; ", "ja492:15.3": "Sammodamānā ekajjhaṁ, ", "ja492:15.4": "uppatanti ḍayanti ca. ", "ja492:16.1": "Tesañca ḍayamānānaṁ, ", "ja492:16.2": "ekettha apasakkati; ", "ja492:16.3": "Tañca seno nitāḷeti, ", "ja492:16.4": "veyyagghiyeva sā gati”. ", "ja492:17.1": "“Ussāhito jaṭilena, ", "ja492:17.2": "luddenāmisacakkhunā; ", "ja492:17.3": "Dāṭhī dāṭhīsu pakkhandi, ", "ja492:17.4": "maññamāno yathā pure”. ", "ja492:18.1": "“Sādhu sambahulā ñātī, ", "ja492:18.2": "api rukkhā araññajā; ", "ja492:18.3": "Sūkarehi samaggehi, ", "ja492:18.4": "byaggho ekāyane hato”. ", "ja492:19.1": "Brāhmaṇañceva byagghañca, ", "ja492:19.2": "ubho hantvāna sūkarā. ", "ja492:19.3": "Ānandino pamuditā, ", "ja492:19.4": "mahānādaṁ panādisuṁ. ", "ja492:20.1": "Te su udumbaramūlasmiṁ, ", "ja492:20.2": "sūkarā susamāgatā; ", "ja492:20.3": "Tacchakaṁ abhisiñciṁsu, ", "ja492:20.4": "“tvaṁ no rājāsi issaro”ti. ", "ja492:21.1": "Tacchasūkarajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja492:0.1": "", "ja492:0.2": "", "ja492:0.3": "", "ja492:0.4": "", "ja492:1.1": "", "ja492:1.2": "", "ja492:1.3": "vicariṁ → vipule (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja492:1.4": "", "ja492:2.1": "", "ja492:2.2": "", "ja492:2.3": "girīnajjo → giri nadiyo (bj, pts-vp-pli1); girinajjo (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja492:2.4": "", "ja492:3.1": "", "ja492:3.2": "", "ja492:3.3": "", "ja492:3.4": "", "ja492:4.1": "Aññampi → aññaṁ hi (bj, pts-vp-pli1); aññañhi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja492:4.2": "", "ja492:4.3": "", "ja492:4.4": "", "ja492:5.1": "numhākaṁ → ko namhākaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja492:5.2": "", "ja492:5.3": "Duppadhaṁse → appadhaṁse (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja492:5.4": "", "ja492:6.1": "", "ja492:6.2": "", "ja492:6.3": "", "ja492:6.4": "", "ja492:7.1": "na vijjanti → nu vijjanti (mr) ", "ja492:7.2": "", "ja492:7.3": "", "ja492:7.4": "", "ja492:8.1": "", "ja492:8.2": "", "ja492:8.3": "", "ja492:8.4": "", "ja492:9.1": "", "ja492:9.2": "", "ja492:9.3": "migavadhāya → miga viriyaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); migaviriya (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja492:9.4": "", "ja492:10.1": "", "ja492:10.2": "", "ja492:10.3": "", "ja492:10.4": "", "ja492:11.1": "", "ja492:11.2": "", "ja492:11.3": "", "ja492:11.4": "", "ja492:12.1": "", "ja492:12.2": "", "ja492:12.3": "", "ja492:12.4": "patthaye → apatthave (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja492:13.1": "", "ja492:13.2": "", "ja492:13.3": "", "ja492:13.4": "", "ja492:14.1": "", "ja492:14.2": "", "ja492:14.3": "", "ja492:14.4": "byagghe → vyagghe ca (bj, pts-vp-pli1); byaggho na (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja492:15.1": "", "ja492:15.2": "", "ja492:15.3": "", "ja492:15.4": "", "ja492:16.1": "", "ja492:16.2": "apasakkati → apavattati (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja492:16.3": "", "ja492:16.4": "", "ja492:17.1": "", "ja492:17.2": "", "ja492:17.3": "", "ja492:17.4": "", "ja492:18.1": "", "ja492:18.2": "", "ja492:18.3": "", "ja492:18.4": "", "ja492:19.1": "", "ja492:19.2": "", "ja492:19.3": "", "ja492:19.4": "", "ja492:20.1": "", "ja492:20.2": "", "ja492:20.3": "", "ja492:20.4": "", "ja492:21.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja492:0.1": "", "ja492:0.2": "", "ja492:0.3": "", "ja492:0.4": "", "ja492:1.1": "ms22J_2715, msdiv160, pts-vp-pli4.344, sya27.392", "ja492:1.2": "", "ja492:1.3": "", "ja492:1.4": "", "ja492:2.1": "ms22J_2716, msdiv161, ndp22.291", "ja492:2.2": "", "ja492:2.3": "", "ja492:2.4": "", "ja492:3.1": "ms22J_2717, msdiv162", "ja492:3.2": "", "ja492:3.3": "", "ja492:3.4": "", "ja492:4.1": "ms22J_2718, msdiv163", "ja492:4.2": "", "ja492:4.3": "", "ja492:4.4": "", "ja492:5.1": "ms22J_2719, msdiv164", "ja492:5.2": "", "ja492:5.3": "", "ja492:5.4": "", "ja492:6.1": "ms22J_2720, msdiv165, pts-vp-pli4.345", "ja492:6.2": "", "ja492:6.3": "", "ja492:6.4": "", "ja492:7.1": "dr27.392, ms22J_2721, msdiv166", "ja492:7.2": "", "ja492:7.3": "", "ja492:7.4": "", "ja492:8.1": "csp1ed22.297, csp2ed22.297, ms22J_2722, msdiv167", "ja492:8.2": "", "ja492:8.3": "", "ja492:8.4": "", "ja492:9.1": "bj30.514, ms22J_2723, msdiv168, pts-vp-pli4.346", "ja492:9.2": "", "ja492:9.3": "", "ja492:9.4": "", "ja492:10.1": "ms22J_2724, msdiv169, sya27.393", "ja492:10.2": "", "ja492:10.3": "", "ja492:10.4": "", "ja492:11.1": "ms22J_2725, msdiv170, ndp22.292", "ja492:11.2": "", "ja492:11.3": "", "ja492:11.4": "", "ja492:12.1": "ms22J_2726, msdiv171, pts-vp-pli4.347", "ja492:12.2": "", "ja492:12.3": "", "ja492:12.4": "", "ja492:13.1": "dr27.393, ms22J_2727, msdiv172, vri68.225", "ja492:13.2": "", "ja492:13.3": "", "ja492:13.4": "", "ja492:14.1": "ms22J_2728, msdiv173", "ja492:14.2": "", "ja492:14.3": "", "ja492:14.4": "", "ja492:15.1": "ms22J_2729, msdiv174", "ja492:15.2": "", "ja492:15.3": "", "ja492:15.4": "", "ja492:16.1": "ms22J_2730, msdiv175", "ja492:16.2": "", "ja492:16.3": "", "ja492:16.4": "", "ja492:17.1": "csp1ed22.298, csp2ed22.298, ms22J_2731, msdiv176, pts-vp-pli4.348, sya27.394", "ja492:17.2": "", "ja492:17.3": "", "ja492:17.4": "", "ja492:18.1": "ms22J_2